{
  "id": "before-trip-chat",
  "titleEn": "Checking in Before a Trip",
  "titleZh": "出行前的问候",
  "descZh": "朋友出行前的小聚，包含关心、帮忙和道别。",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "en": "What are you up to?",
      "zh": "你在忙啥呢？",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "What are you up to?", "zh": "你在忙啥呢？" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "en": "Packing for my trip. So far so good.",
      "zh": "在收拾旅行行李。目前一切顺利。",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "So far so good.", "zh": "目前一切顺利。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "en": "Can you repeat that?",
      "zh": "可以重复一遍吗？",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "Can you repeat that?", "zh": "可以重复一遍吗？" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "en": "So far so good. Please sit down.",
      "zh": "目前一切顺利。请坐。",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "Please sit down.", "zh": "请坐。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "en": "Thanks a lot. Can you turn off the light?",
      "zh": "十分感谢。可以把灯关掉吗？",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "Thanks a lot.", "zh": "十分感谢。" },
        { "en": "Can you turn off the light?", "zh": "可以把灯关掉吗？" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "en": "Right away.",
      "zh": "马上。",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "Right away.", "zh": "马上。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "en": "It's fine. Have fun!",
      "zh": "没事。玩得开心！",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "It's fine.", "zh": "没事。" },
        { "en": "Have fun.", "zh": "玩得开心。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "en": "Catch you later.",
      "zh": "晚点聊。",
      "keyExpressions": [
        { "en": "Catch you later.", "zh": "晚点聊。" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "tipsZh": [
    "What are you up to? 是口语中非常常用的问候，相当于“你在忙什么呢？”",
    "So far so good. 表示“到目前为止一切都好”，适合回答近况。",
    "Can you repeat that? 没听清对方的话时，可以礼貌地请对方重复。",
    "Right away. 表示“马上、立刻”，回应别人的请求时很干脆。",
    "Catch you later. 是“晚点聊、回头见”的意思，适合朋友间道别。"
  ]
},
